{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_025_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c918f69869a1929e288ff4dfc6a5f64819fbe64bf07dd6fa8c2a159263ebeb54",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dcbc07e8656d5abe021742b81907bf80761645f0931299324924dbaac75e123",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー啊，\n这是情人节的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7a76a1e1c644b6bba0eba6602657cdcee19eae844f383294c759ece2802b637",
      "text": "收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf7cbdc9ca2bf706ea7762dbeb3a2a6a784811cd051372eec24202e3da9af80e",
      "text": "喵子也有帮忙一起找哦！\n对吧，喵子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb5f9a544df6e845ea038fb2f49b2b8916aa88abd4356d77fd948d90e62f912",
      "text": "喵喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8bd9f79b74110dab510f15c90e5215652e94d8388798804711f632cc75b1a7",
      "text": "这可是倾注了我们炽热灵魂挑选出来的东西。\n你要是能喜欢的话俺就高兴啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5552732e08d167469a1ba470382b96fdca44ba69b844d8d3d6fa5ef2e1d4072a",
      "text": "喂、喂，●●●●プロデューサー啊。\n能借一步说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27b0dcd4e97348dc4bad92a3907232534aa1cceda788a09053c92c7c96cf92aa",
      "text": "那个……这是白色情人节的礼物！\n收下吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48a63776864f3300d61095e5e6361014bf1d25b7cd40356b31802c490cc9eaa",
      "text": "呼——……紧张死俺了……\n俺实在不习惯这种事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:908ee729e61161129c39b6bfa3010fabc51ba47f64ed715b84a43ead6286b6ab",
      "text": "但是啊，想着●●●●プロデューサー\n大概会喜欢这种东西吧，之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db96de4dbb84faf03e896cab1efa9d018054caa9162e80911da7f297c612720b",
      "text": "把这个当礼物送出去的话肯定会高兴吧！之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21c6ccb53a37205adc26f75dac2cf78e9119cd3b3ab930a423d9b8c503be36b3",
      "text": "一边想着●●●●プロデューサー的事，\n一边四处逛着看，超级开心的啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000044:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:629caf3d1185e45c872e04e1b16f10f355efefd3bcb7e6468009dbad48647c11",
      "text": "非常感谢！感受到你的干劲了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000045:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf37adc5b092d7194baf97226b115cddd8f60b8e1918d73f95091b81983b225a",
      "text": "好开心！这是最炽热的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f69dd9e29abedabc42f23c1cfc0eca7d86034cd006379ed067e66e6fd45dde",
      "text": "对吧！俺可是倾注了毫不含糊的干劲挑出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56dee2aff2071e2da8a683477028ddb137737d8b7d4b0f402303f3f4c29e027",
      "text": "是啊，毕竟倾注了俺炽热的心意嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_025_22:5_02_025_22_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:befbf9c1a0894233ee5da1944c7b48f494f970c188c836f482d2d6d6b10a512f",
      "text": "能传达给你真是太好啦。\n约定俺可好好遵守了啊，制作人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
